[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆様方……今まで隠していて、ごめんなさい！\n拙者……実は……なんと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone... I'm sorry for keeping this hidden! I... actually... am..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "忍びの家の出なのでありまする！\n今日は一族に伝わる忍術をお見せいたしましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From a ninja clan! Today, I shall show you the secret arts passed down through my family!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ……！\u3000忍術って、どんななんだろう……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa...! I wonder what ninja arts are like...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっと、マジックみたいなものでしょ。\nどうせ大したことは――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's probably just like magic tricks. Nothing special, I'm sure—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "忍法・口寄せの術！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ninja Art: Summoning Jutsu!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええーっ！？\u3000どこから！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat?! Where'd that come from?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！？\u3000なにこれ！\u3000すごいじゃない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! What is this?! That's amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだまだありまする！\u3000シュッ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's more! Whoosh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これが縮地の術！\u3000ライブでもステージの端から端まで\n一瞬で移動できまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is the Ground-Shrinking Technique! I can move from one end of the stage to the other in an instant during a live!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんた、そんな技を隠し持ってたわけ！？\nもっと見せなさいよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've been hiding a skill like that this whole time?! Show me more!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれー？\u3000ヨハナ、さっきはマジックみたいな\nものだろう、って言ってたのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? But Johanna, you just said it was probably like magic tricks."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ！？\u3000う、うるさい！\n……期待以上だったから、少し興奮しただけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?! Sh-Shut up! ...It just exceeded my expectations, so I got a little excited."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライブでボーっとしてたら、見失うかも？\nだから、よーく拙者を見てるでござるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you zone out during the live, you might lose sight of me, you know? So keep your eyes on me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ。急に笑って……何を見てるの？\nもしかして鏡かしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh. You suddenly laughed... What are you looking at? A mirror?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな面白い顔してるかな！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is my face really that funny?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本日アップされた、\n『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』の動画と認識",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Recognition: the video uploaded today by 'Cutie☆AnimaL.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "'Cutie☆AnimaL'?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。最近デビューしたアイドルユニットなんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. They're an idol unit that debuted recently."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "公式ＳＮＳの情報によれば、彼女たちも\nカウントダウンフェスの審査枠に応募した模様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "According to their official social media, they also applied for the Countdown Fest audition slots."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど。ライバルってことね。\n負けるわけにはいかないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. So they're rivals. We can't afford to lose."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、見て……これ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But look... at this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。なんだか、笑顔になれるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. It just makes me smile."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]